        <item>
            <title>1.0.3</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — thanks for testing.
</p>
<h3>New</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Send Feedback.</strong> Report a bug or suggest a feature from the right-click menu on the menu bar icon.</li>
<li><strong>Crash reports.</strong> If the app quits unexpectedly, it offers to send a crash report the next time it opens.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Bug fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Reconnects after sleep.</strong> No more "Lost connection to speakers" after your Mac wakes up.</li>
<li><strong>Recovers on its own.</strong> If the connection to your speakers gets stuck, the app resets it automatically.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
