        <item>
            <title>1.0.2</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — thanks for testing.
</p>
<h3>Bug fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Play and pause respond instantly.</strong> The button switches the moment you click, with a small spinner until the speaker catches up.</li>
<li><strong>Album art stays current.</strong> Artwork now updates every time the song changes.</li>
<li><strong>Drag the mini player.</strong> Move it by its artwork or any empty space.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
